 audit -- GREEN, 0.08 is generalization not compute

Two retrievable probe kernels on the real P100 settled it: the OOM hypothesis is refuted (the frozen
ctx=16384+MTP config loads with 4.5GB free), and the FULL agent path imports + the proposer generates
correct code (carnot-arc-agent-smoke: agent_import_ok + proposer_ran + correct is_win output, 10.2GB
free at MTP=0). Set CARNOT_ARC_MTP=0 (frees ~5.8GB, no quality change). 0.08 triangulates to a
solve-rate wall on hidden OOD games (conductor A1/A2), not a Carnot-side compute/load problem.

